        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Come now, you two. Pick your Pokémon."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "shauna",
            "lines": [
                "I don't know which one to pick! It's so difficult!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "serena",
            "lines": [
                "You'll be together for a long time, so just take your time."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Well, I've got a feeling everyone else will show up soon."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' unless entity @e[x=-268,y=121,z=97,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] run npcspawnat -268 121 97 trevor_generic');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' unless entity @e[x=-266,y=121,z=97,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] run npcspawnat -266 121 97 tierno_generic');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "tierno",
            "lines": [
                "Hi, Professor Sycamore."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "What's this? Everyone is already here."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "See. Wonderful! Everyone's all here!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "So now that we're all here, I'd like to say a few words."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Be the best Trainer you can be! At the same time, remember to have fun traveling with your Pokémon!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Also, I want to ask for your help in solving the Kalos region's biggest Pokémon mystery:"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "the secret and potential of Mega Evolution, a new kind of Evolution that occurs in battle!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "That's why I gave you that Mega Stone just now. It's an important clue!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "Mega Evolution? What should we do about the Pokédex?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Trevor, my lad, if that's what “best Trainer” means to you, then I want you to go out there and complete that Pokédex!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "shauna",
            "lines": [
                "Mega Evolution sounds really interesting!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page17');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page17",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "If you're investigating Mega Evolution, why don't you check out Camphrier Town?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page18');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page18",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "That town has a lot of history--you might find a hint there!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page19');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page19",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Now listen."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page20');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page20",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "If you visit many different places to complete the Pokédex,"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page21');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page21",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "you will probably see Pokémon with many ways of living and meet people with many ways of thinking."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page22');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page22",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "First, accept the ways of living and thinking that sometimes conflict with your own."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page23');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page23",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "And think about what's really important--this will truly broaden your horizons."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page24');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page24",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I feel that being different from others makes me special."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page25');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page25",
            "speaker": "serena",
            "lines": [
                "Mastering Mega Evolution will definitely set me apart from other Trainers!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Close",
